  "description": "Token 用量看板：在设置页里查看 DSH 所有会话的 token 消耗、趋势与成本估算 / A token usage dashboard for DeepSeek Harness, shown as a Settings section",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "git+https://github.com/D1a0y1bb/dsh-token-dashboard.git"
  },
